"To dictate from the keyboard, turn on Listening in VoiceDraft first. Without it the keyboard can still insert the last result." = "要从键盘听写，请先在 VoiceDraft 中打开“监听”。未打开时，键盘仍可插入最近的结果。";
"Upload this iPhone's settings" = "上传这台 iPhone 的设置";
"Use HTTPS, or HTTP on localhost for development. The token and passphrase stay in this iPhone's Keychain. Settings and keys are encrypted with the passphrase before upload; history and audio are never synced." = "请使用 HTTPS；开发时可在 localhost 上使用 HTTP。令牌和口令保存在本机钥匙串中。设置和密钥在上传前用口令加密；历史记录和音频永不同步。";
"Use the VoiceDraft keyboard to insert the last result into any app, or to start a take while listening is on." = "使用 VoiceDraft 键盘可把最近的结果插入任意 App；打开监听后还可以直接从键盘开始录音。";
