"During standby the keyboard can start and stop takes without opening VoiceDraft. The microphone stays open, so the orange microphone indicator stays on. Audio outside a take is discarded and never sent. The keyboard also starts standby by itself after it opens VoiceDraft to record." = "待机期间，键盘无需打开 VoiceDraft 就能开始和结束录音。麦克风保持开启，所以橙色麦克风指示灯会一直亮着。录音之外的音频会被丢弃，不会发送。键盘打开 VoiceDraft 录音后也会自动进入待机。";
"Standby ends at {0}." = "待机将在 {0} 结束。";
