"During standby the app stays resident in the background; the microphone opens only while you hold to talk" = "待机期间 App 在后台常驻，麦克风只在你按下说话时打开";
"Keep microphone open during standby" = "待机期间保持麦克风打开";
"Keeping the microphone open avoids background recording start failures but shows the microphone indicator during standby" = "保持麦克风打开可避免后台无法启动录音的问题，但待机期间会一直显示麦克风指示";
"Recording. Tap the back arrow or swipe from the bottom edge to return to the previous app and keep talking; finish from the keyboard." = "录音已开始。点左上角返回或从底边右滑回到刚才的 App 继续说，说完在键盘上点结束";
"VoiceDraft could not keep standby in the background: {0}. The next tap opens VoiceDraft." = "VoiceDraft 无法在后台保持待机：{0}。下次点击会打开 VoiceDraft。";
"During standby the keyboard can start and stop takes without opening VoiceDraft. VoiceDraft stays resident in the background and opens the microphone only while you hold to talk, so the microphone indicator is off between takes. The keyboard also starts standby by itself after it opens VoiceDraft to record." = "待机期间，键盘无需打开 VoiceDraft 就能开始和结束录音。VoiceDraft 在后台常驻，麦克风只在你按下说话时打开，所以两次录音之间不会显示麦克风指示。键盘打开 VoiceDraft 录音后也会自动进入待机。";
"Starting standby briefly opens the microphone to prepare it. After you leave VoiceDraft, a small Picture in Picture window keeps standby available. Drag it to the screen edge to tuck it away; closing it ends standby." = "开启待机时会短暂打开麦克风进行准备。离开 VoiceDraft 后，小画中画窗口会维持待机。把它拖到屏幕边缘即可收起；关闭它会结束待机。";
"VoiceDraft on standby" = "VoiceDraft 待机";
"Recording" = "正在录音";
"Starting standby briefly prepares the microphone. Standby hides automatically without a floating window or edge arrow. Turn off standby here to end it." = "开启待机时会短暂初始化麦克风。待机会自动隐藏，不显示悬浮窗或边缘箭头。需要结束时，在这里关闭待机即可。";
"Hidden standby is unavailable on this iOS version." = "当前 iOS 版本无法启用隐藏待机。";
